; Production 90CN.dll does not read 90CN.ini.
;
; Its supported settings are environment variables documented in README.md:
; DNF_RESIDENT_CHANNEL_ID, DNF_CIPHER_PASSTHROUGH,
; DNF_DPROTO_COMPAT, DNF_ROUTE_COMPAT, and DNF_PROTOCOL_TRACE.
;
; Debug compatibility belongs to the independent 90CN-debug test project.
; Do not copy this example to the game directory.
